engine.autoInstallUnavailable:
Auto-install unavailable on {{platform}} — {{asset}} isn't tar-compatible. Install manually:
  1. Download {{url}}
  2. Extract iii.exe and place it on PATH (e.g. %USERPROFILE%\.local\bin)
Or use Docker: docker pull iiidev/iii:{{version}}

stop.preservingManualCleanup:
Preserving ~/.agentmemory/iii.pid + worker.pid. Investigate before manual cleanup:
  ps -p {{pids}} -o pid,ppid,comm,etime
  {{diagnostic}}

pi.note:
Run these from the agentmemory repo root:

  mkdir -p {{extDir}}
  cp integrations/pi/index.ts {{extDir}}/index.ts
  cp integrations/pi/security.ts {{extDir}}/security.ts

Then add to ~/.pi/agent/settings.json:
  { "extensions": ["~/.pi/agent/extensions/agentmemory"] }

Full guide: {{docs}}
